{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-vs-spot-mix-gri-pss","title":"长协 vs 现货配比与年度谈判（GRI/PSS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/freight-procurement-strategy/contract-vs-spot-mix-gri-pss","wordCount":1882,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"长协-vs-现货配比与年度谈判-gri-pss\">长协 vs 现货配比与年度谈判（GRI/PSS）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>运量分析给出的是&quot;哪些 lane 的货量可预测&quot;，年度谈判要回答的是&quot;这些可预测的货量该以什么形式买下来&quot;。全走长协，你放弃了市场下行时的低价；全走现货，你在旺季舱位紧张时最先被甩。配比问题的本质不是&quot;哪个更便宜&quot;，而是<strong>在价格确定性与供给确定性之间选一个组合</strong>——这也是为什么它无法用单一公式解出，而必须与年度谈判的节奏绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长协与现货的成本结构差异\">长协与现货的成本结构差异</h2><p>长协（service contract / rate agreement）与现货（spot）不是同一个商品的两个价格，而是两份不同的合约。长协买到的是<strong>运价上限 + 舱位优先级</strong>，代价是承诺最低货量（MQC）与更长的锁定期；现货买到的是<strong>灵活性</strong>，代价是价格随市场波动，且在舱位紧张时排序靠后。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>长协 (contract)</th>\n<th>现货 (spot)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格确定性</td>\n<td>高（基价锁定，附加费按规则联动）</td>\n<td>低（周度波动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舱位保障</td>\n<td>有约定（MFO/MQC 对应）</td>\n<td>无，按市场排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货量约束</td>\n<td>有 MQC，未达标可能触发违约条款</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁定期</td>\n<td>通常 6–12 个月</td>\n<td>单票</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合的货量特征</td>\n<td>低 <code>cv</code>、流向稳定</td>\n<td>高 <code>cv</code>、季节性尖峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谈判成本</td>\n<td>高（年度一轮）</td>\n<td>低（每票比价）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"长协的隐性成本-mqc-差额\">长协的隐性成本：MQC 差额</h3><p>MQC（minimum quantity commitment）是长协里最容易被低估的条款。承诺了 4,000 FEU/年而实际只走了 2,800，差额部分要么按合同约定赔偿，要么触发&quot;未达量则费率回溯上调&quot;的条款。海运长协的必备条款里明确包含<strong>最低货量或最低比例</strong>与<strong>未履约的约定损害赔偿（liquidated damages, if any）</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-46/part-530\">46 CFR § 530.8</a>）。</p>\n<p>因此配比计算的正确形式不是&quot;长协便宜就走长协&quot;，而是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>预期总成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>长协部分</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>现货部分</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>MQC 缺口罚金</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{预期总成本} = \\underbrace{Q_c \\cdot (P_c + \\Delta)}_{\\text{长协部分}} + \\underbrace{Q_s \\cdot \\mathbb{E}[P_s]}_{\\text{现货部分}} + \\underbrace{\\lambda \\cdot \\mathbb{E}[\\max(0, M - Q_c)]}_{\\text{MQC 缺口罚金}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预期总成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">长协部分</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"m