/span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4624em;vertical-align:-1.7124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MQC </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">缺口罚金</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际走长协的货量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位缺口罚金。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 这一项常常等于甚至超过基价差带来的节省——这就是为什么&quot;多签长约&quot;并不总是更划算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"附加费在两类合约里的不对称\">附加费在两类合约里的不对称</h3><p>长协与现货的差异不止在基价。长协里的附加费通常按合同规则联动（燃油 FSC 按指数、旺季 PSS 按事先约定的封顶），现货里的附加费则随行就市、常常在订舱时才披露。所以在比较这两条路径时，<strong>基价差只是分子的一部分</strong>，附加费的不确定性折扣才是决定性的。这一点在 <a href=\"../contract-rate-management/fuel-residential-peak-surcharge\">燃油/住宅/旺季等附加费规则</a> 里有完整公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配比决策-用-cv-和期望成本做分层\">配比决策：用 cv 和期望成本做分层</h2><p>配比决策可以拆成三步，且每一步都有可计算的判据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一步-按-cv-分层\">第一步：按 cv 分层</h3><p>用 <a href=\"../freight-procurement-strategy/freight-category-lane-zone-analysis\">运量立方体</a> 算出的变异系数把 lane 分成三档：<code>cv &lt; 0.35</code> 为稳定型，<code>0.35 ≤ cv &lt; 0.7</code> 为波动型，<code>cv ≥ 0.7</code> 为尖峰型。稳定型优先长协，尖峰型优先现货，波动型视谈判筹码而定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二步-算两路的全成本期望\">第二步：算两路的全成本期望</h3><p>对每个 lane 分别算&quot;全走长协&quot;与&quot;全走现货&quot;的期望全成本（含附加费期望与 MQC 罚金期望），取较低者为基准，然后引入风险偏好——风险厌恶的采购方愿意为确定性支付溢价，这个溢价的大小应写成明确的参数而不是隐性的偏好。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三步-设配比上下限\">第三步：设配比上下限</h3><p>纯粹按期望成本算出的最优解可能是&quot;100% 长协&quot;或&quot;100% 现货&quot;，但这在现实中不可执行：100% 长协意味着丧失应对市场下行的能力，100% 现货意味着旺季无保障。所以最后一步是加<strong>业务约束</strong>：长协占比不低于 X%（保证旺季基本盘），不高于 Y%（保留议价弹性）。X 与 Y 由业务决策给定，不由模型输出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分层与配比建议：按 cv 分档，输出长协建议占比&#10;WITH lane_stats AS (&#10;  SELECT lane_id,&#10;         AVG(billed_weight) AS avg_w,&#10;         STDDEV_POP(billed_weight) / NULLIF(AVG(billed_weight), 0) AS cv,&#10;         SUM(billed_weight) AS annual_volume&#10;  FROM freight_volume_cube&#10;  WHERE week_start &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;52 weeks&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY lane_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT lane_id, annual_volume, ROUND(cv, 3) AS cv,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN cv &lt; 0.35 THEN 0.80   -- 稳定型：长协为主&#10;         WHEN cv &lt; 0.70 THEN 0.55   -- 波动型：均衡&#10;         ELSE 0.25                  -- 尖峰型：现货为主&#10;       END AS contract_ratio_target,&#10;       ROUND(annual_volume * CASE&#10;         WHEN cv &lt; 0.35 THEN 0.80 WHEN cv &lt; 0.70 THEN 0.55 ELSE 0.25 END) AS commit_volume&#10;FROM lane_stats&#10;WHERE annual_volume &gt; 0&#10;ORDER BY annual_volume DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分层与配比建议：按 cv 分档，输出长协建议占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_w,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         STDDEV_POP(billed_weight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annual_volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_volume_cube</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> week_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'52 weeks'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, annual_volume, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cv, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   -- 稳定型：长协为主</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   -- 波动型：均衡</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  -- 尖峰型：现货为主</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract_ratio_target,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(annual_volume </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commit_volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annual_volume </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annual_volume </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>contract_ratio_target</code> 只是模型的<strong>建议起点</strong>，实际承诺量还要扣除 MQC 罚金期望后回代验证——若某个 lane 的承诺量在历史最差年份也达不到，就应该下调它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"年度谈判-节奏与筹码\">年度谈判：节奏与筹码</h2><p>货运年度谈判有固定的时间结构：招标（Q4）→ 签约（Q4/Q1）→ 执行（全年）→ GRI/PSS 博弈（每季度与旺季）。谈判的胜负往往不在签约桌上，而在执行期的每一次涨价通知里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Q4 运量分析与 RFP] --&gt; B[Q4-Q1 授标与签约&lt;br/&gt;基价+MQC+附加费规则]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Q1 执行&lt;br/&gt;费率生效版本切换]&#10;  C --&gt; D{GRI 通知?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[核对合同是否封顶&lt;br/&gt;引用合同条款抗辩]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[PSS 旺季窗口?]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[核对合同 PSS 条款&lt;br/&gt;是否含例外清单]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[季度绩效回顾&lt;br/&gt;履约数据回流谈判]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[下一年度招标&lt;br/&gt;用兑现率调整权重]\">graph TD\n  A[Q4 运量分析与 RFP] --&gt; B[Q4-Q1 授标与签约&lt;br/&gt;基价+MQC+附加费规则]\n  B --&gt; C[Q1 执行&lt;br/&gt;费率生效版本切换]\n  C --&gt; D{GRI 通知?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[核对合同是否封顶&lt;br/&gt;引用合同条款抗辩]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[PSS 旺季窗口?]\n  F --&gt;|是| G[核对合同 PSS 条款&lt;br/&gt;是否含例外清单]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[季度绩效回顾&lt;br/&gt;履约数据回流谈判]\n  E --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[下一年度招标&lt;br/&gt;用兑现率调整权重]</pre><h3 id=\"gri-生效日决定谁付哪个价\">GRI：生效日决定谁付哪个价</h3><p>GRI（General Rate Increase）是承运商在公开运价本（tariff）里上调费率的行为。它对本票货是否适用，取决于<strong>运费适用的时点规则</strong>：适用的费率与规则是<strong>货物被承运人或其代理人接收当日</strong>生效的那一版（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-46/part-520\">46 CFR § 520.7(c)</a>）。这条规则给谈判提供了明确的锚点——GRI 的生效日若晚于货物接收日，本票不适用；早于，则适用，除非合同另有封顶约定。</p>\n<p>运价本本身也有格式化要求：必须清晰明确（clear and definite），且不得与其它运价本出版物重复或冲突（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-46/part-520\">46 CFR § 520.7</a>）。这意味着 GRI 不能以模糊的&quot;视市场情况调整&quot;形式发布，它必须是一个有明确生效日与明确费率的条款——你据此可以逐条核对承运商的涨价通知是否合规。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pss-旺季附加费的窗口与例外\">PSS：旺季附加费的窗口与例外</h3><p>PSS（Peak Season Surcharge）通常在旺季舱位紧张期启用，按周或按月整段上浮。谈判要争取的不是&quot;取消 PSS&quot;，而是三件事：<strong>窗口的定义方式</strong>（固定日期还是触发条件）、<strong>单位挂载方式</strong>（按箱、按重量还是按 TEU）、以及<strong>例外清单</strong>（已签约的 MQC 内货量是否豁免 PSS）。第三条最有价值，因为它把 PSS 的影响限制在超出承诺量的部分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"谈判筹码的构成\">谈判筹码的构成</h3><p>年度谈判的筹码不是&quot;我要换供应商&quot;这句威胁，而是<strong>可验证的数据</strong>：过去一年的实际兑现率、审计发现的超收金额（第三章产出的）、以及该 lane 在现货市场的实际成交价（可用公开指数做参照）。集装箱即期运价有公开的周度指数可比对，例如 Drewry 的世界集装箱指数按主要东西向航线逐周发布运价（<a href=\"https://www.drewry.co.uk/supply-chain-advisors/world-container-index-assessed-by-drewry\">Drewry World Container Index</a>）。拿着指数与自己的实付价对比，&quot;你的报价高于市场&quot;就从主观判断变成了可核对的事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>长协买的是价格上限与舱位优先级，现货买的是灵活性；两者是不同合约，不是同一商品的两个价格。</li>\n<li>MQC 缺口罚金必须进入成本公式，否则&quot;多签长约&quot;看起来总是更省。</li>\n<li>配比决策分三步：按 <code>cv</code> 分层 → 算两路全成本期望 → 加业务上下限约束。</li>\n<li>GRI 是否适用取决于<strong>货物接收日</strong>生效的费率版本，这是抗辩的锚点。</li>\n<li>PSS 谈判的核心是窗口定义、单位挂载与已承诺量豁免清单。</li>\n<li>谈判筹码来自可验证的数据：兑现率、审计超收额、以及公开的即期运价指数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"长协 vs 现货配比与年度谈判（GRI/PSS）","id":"长协-vs-现货配比与年度谈判-gri-pss"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"长协与现货的成本结构差异","id":"长协与现货的成本结构差异"},{"level":3,"text":"长协的隐性成本：MQC 差额","id":"长协的隐性成本-mqc-差额"},{"level":3,"text":"附加费在两类合约里的不对称","id":"附加费在两类合约里的不对称"},{"level":2,"text":"配比决策：用 cv 和期望成本做分层","id":"配比决策-用-cv-和期望成本做分层"},{"level":3,"text":"第一步：按 cv 分层","id":"第一步-按-cv-分层"},{"level":3,"text":"第二步：算两路的全成本期望","id":"第二步-算两路的全成本期望"},{"level":3,"text":"第三步：设配比上下限","id":"第三步-设配比上下限"},{"level":2,"text":"年度谈判：节奏与筹码","id":"年度谈判-节奏与筹码"},{"level":3,"text":"GRI：生效日决定谁付哪个价","id":"gri-生效日决定谁付哪个价"},{"level":3,"text":"PSS：旺季附加费的窗口与例外","id":"pss-旺季附加费的窗口与例外"},{"level":3,"text":"谈判筹码的构成","id":"谈判筹码的构成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"招投标 RFP/RFQ 与竞价流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/freight-procurement-strategy/freight-rfp-rfq-bid-event"},"next":{"title":"合同费率库（base/附加费/FSC/DIM 除数）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/contract-rate-management/contract-rate-library-accessorial"}}